# A RESOLVED chain, written by `shipinfer plan` -- do not hand-edit.
plan 3 minimal
setting workers 7
setting pipeline_queue 257
setting instance_queue 65
setting enqueue_block_timeout_ms 51
setting stage_timeout_ms 5001
setting reassembly_capacity 1025
setting reassembly_timeout_ms 1501
setting reassembly_sweep_ms 101
policy power_of_two
policy_option probes 3

node decode decode replay

node output output jsonlines

edge decode output bgr@cpu
